      <div class="method-grid">
        <div class="method-item">
          <span class="method-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="13" r="7.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75"/><path d="M12 13L16 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M9 4h6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span>
          <div><h3>Motor</h3><p>Potência contínua declarada pelo fabricante, não a de pico. Decide se dá para correr ou só caminhar.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="method-item">
          <span class="method-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="3" y="10" width="18" height="4.5" rx="1.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75"/><path d="M7.5 10v4.5M12 10v4.5M16.5 10v4.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></span>
          <div><h3>Lona</h3><p>Largura × comprimento do tapete. Precisa caber a sua altura e o seu tipo de passada.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="method-item">
          <span class="method-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="2.5" y="9.5" width="3.5" height="6" rx="1" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="18" y="9.5" width="3.5" height="6" rx="1" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="5.5" y="11.25" width="13" height="2.5" rx="1" fill="currentColor"/></svg></span>
